Diviskit — Licensing
====================

This distribution bundles components under two licenses:

WordPress plugins (GPL-2.0-or-later)
------------------------------------
- diviskit-agent          (plugins/diviskit-agent/, diviskit-agent.zip)
- diviskit-design-library (plugins/diviskit-design-library/, diviskit-design-library.zip)

GPL-2.0-or-later: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html

diviskit-agent and diviskit-design-library are GPL-licensed forks of the
GPL-licensed DiviOps Agent / DiviOps Design Library plugins and remain under
the same license terms.

MCP server + skills + documentation (MIT)
-----------------------------------------
- diviskit-server/        (@diviskit/mcp-server npm package source;
                           full MIT text in diviskit-server/LICENSE)
- claude/                 (skill bundle + .claude-plugin manifest)
- bin/, templates/, README.md, SETUP.md, CHANGELOG.md

